class=\"wrap\">\n        <div class=\"section-head\">\n          <div class=\"eyebrow\">BEFORE / AFTER</div>\n          <h2>同样的内容，换一种写法</h2>\n          <p>切换下面的示例，看看妙笔是如何把草稿变成拿得出手的成稿的。</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"demo\">\n          <div class=\"tabs\" role=\"tablist\">\n            <button class=\"tab\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\" data-key=\"report\">📊 改周报</button>\n            <button class=\"tab\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-key=\"email\">✉️ 改邮件</button>\n            <button class=\"tab\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-key=\"decline\">🙅 委婉拒绝</button>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"compare\">\n            <div class=\"pane before\">\n              <span class=\"pane-label\">原稿</span>\n              <div class=\"pane-body\" id=\"before\"></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</div>\n            <div class=\"pane after\">\n              <span class=\"pane-label\">妙笔改写</span>\n              <div class=\"pane-body\" id=\"after\"></div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"demo-foot\" id=\"chips\"></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Use cases -->\n    <section id=\"cases\">\n      <div class=\"wrap\">\n        <div class=\"section-head\">\n          <div class=\"eyebrow\">核心场景</div>\n          <h2>职场里最耗神的两件写作小事，交给妙笔</h2>\n          <p>我们把最常见、最高频的周报和邮件场景打磨到极致。</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"cases\">\n          <article class=\"case\">\n            <div class=\"case-icon\">📊</div>\n            <h3>周报改写</h3>\n            <p>把\"做了什么\"变成\"带来了什么\"，让领导一眼看到你的价值。</p>\n            <ul class=\"checks\">\n              <li>自动归纳为「本周进展 / 关键成果 / 风险问题 / 下周计划」结构</li>\n              <li>把模糊描述转换为可量化的结果与数据</li>\n              <li>提炼亮点放在前面，弱化琐碎事务</li>\n              <li>支持日报、周报、月报、季度述职多种模板</li>\n              <li>可导入任务清单、会议纪要，一键生成初稿</li>\n            </ul>\n          </article>\n\n          <article class=\"case\">\n            <div class=\"case-icon\">✉️</div>\n            <h3>邮件润色</h3>\n            <p>措辞得体、意图清楚，不再为一封邮件纠结半小时。</p>\n            <ul class=\"checks\">\n              <li>根据收件人（上级 / 客户 / 同事）自动调整语气</li>\n              <li>一键切换：更正式、更简洁、更委婉、更有说服力</li>\n              <li>自动补全称呼、主题行与结尾落款</li>\n              <li>催进度、拒绝请求、道歉说明等敏感场景都有妥帖表达</li>\n              <li>中英双语互译润色，海外沟通同样地道</li>\n            </ul>\n          </article>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Features -->\n    <section id=\"features\">\n      <div class=\"wrap\">\n        <div class=\"section-head\">\n          <div class=\"eyebrow\">更多能力</div>\n          <h2>不只是改字，更懂你的工作语境</h2>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"features\">\n          <div class=\"feature\">\n            <div class=\"ico\">🎯</div>\n            <h4>语气精准调节</h4>\n            <p>正式、亲切、简洁、坚定……滑动即可切换，满足不同对象的沟通需要。</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"feature\">\n            <div class=\"ico\">🧠</div>\n            <h4>记住你的风格</h4>\n            <p>学习你过往的写作习惯和团队术语，改出来的内容依然\"像你写的\"。</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"feature\">\n            <div class=\"ico\">🔍</div>\n            <h4>逐句修改说明</h4>\n            <p>每处改动都标注原因，可单句接受或撤销，你始终掌握最终决定权。</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"feature\">\n            <div class=\"ico\">🧩</div>\n            <h4>无缝嵌入工作流</h4>\n            <p>支持浏览器插件、邮箱客户端、飞书、钉钉、企业微信与 Office，选中即改。</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"feature\">\n            <div class=\"ico\">📚</div>\n            <h4>团队模板库</h4>\n            <p>统一团队周报格式和对外邮件规范，新人也能写出标准化文档。</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"feature\">\n            <div class=\"ico\">🔒</div>\n            <h4>数据安全</h4>\n            <p>传输全程加密，内容不用于模型训练，企业版支持私有化部署。</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- How -->\n    <section id=\"how\">\n      <div class=\"wrap\">\n        <div class=\"section-head\">\n          <div class=\"eyebrow\">三步上手</div>\n          <h2>30 秒，完成一份周报或一封邮件</h